caption:
“Why don't you attack them?”

A call record submitted to the tribunal reveals Obaidul Quader urging attacks on students during the July uprising.

The prosecution has submitted a call record as evidence in a case regarding crimes against humanity during the July mass uprising. The recording is allegedly between former Road Transport and Bridges Minister Obaidul Quader and Chhatra League president Saddam Hossain.

